<h2>The case in one view</h2>
<table class="law">
  <tr><th>Case</th><td>M/s Balmer Lawrie &amp; Co. Ltd v. Ruia Chemicals Pvt. Ltd. &amp; Anr., AO-COM 39 of 2026 with CAN 4 of 2026</td></tr>
